# Same bytes on every OS. DVC hashes raw file bytes, so CRLF checkouts on Windows would change the hashes of
# source files and generated data recorded in dvc.lock and break the CI reproducibility check.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.db binary
